    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44331" root="&#xA;                        هلك&#xA;                    " body-key="h1">
                        
                            10
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِسْتَهْلَكَ</span></b> 
                         properly signifies <i>He sought, or
courted, destruction;</i> like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِسْتَمَاتَ</span>: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسْتَمِيتَ</span>:
and see an ex. voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَرْشَرَةٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِسْتَهْلَكَ فِى كَذَا</span>
                        <i>He</i> (a man) <i>distressed, troubled,</i> or <i>fatigued,
himself in,</i> or <i>respecting, such a thing.</i> (TA.)
See also 6.

